;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ROBINRMX.MAC -- additional room elements.
;
; Ported verbatim from the ZX original, $8511-$8A36.  Labels keep the original
; addresses: L<hex address>.
;
; Indexed by room number, not by room type: 256. entries, rooms $00-$FF, in
; order.  Entry format matches the room type descriptors at L7B39 -- a token
; count byte followed by that many 2-byte tokens (coordinate byte + block
; number).  A count of 000 means the room has no additional elements.
;
; Entries are variable length and packed sequentially with no fixed stride, so
; reaching entry N means walking forward from L8511 summing 2*count+1 for each
; preceding entry -- what the ZX routine at $C1C1 does.
;
; Only rooms $0000-$00FF have entries here.  $C072 returns early when the room
; number's high byte is non-zero, so rooms $0100-$013D get room type graphics
; only.
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------

; Room $00
L8511:	.BYTE	000				; 0. tokens

; Room $01
